### Test insufficient stock (only 1 unit available)

### Test negative unit price

POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "productName": "Test Mouse",
    "quantity": 1,
    "unitPrice": -450.00
}
### Test API without authentication

GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales
Accept: application/json

### Test overselling protection

POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales
Authorization: Basic ZGV2dXNlcjpDaG9vc2VZb3VyT3duTG9jYWxQYXNzd29yZDEyMyE=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "productName": "Test Mouse",
    "quantity": 2,
    "unitPrice": 450.00
}

