### Create a regular business user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username": "businessuser",
    "password": "1234Ranjani!",
    "role": "BUSINESS_USER"
}
### Test: Business user must not create accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "businessuser",
  "password": "1234Ranjani!",
  "role": "BUSINESS_USER"
}
### Create Viewer user

POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46WU9VUl9BRE1JTl9QQVNTV09SRA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

